learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-07T14:58:09.214Z","harness:codex","Cross-layer work is reliably complete only when the repository declares the expected replication set and activates enforcement from the changed diff. Prose checklists cannot detect a forgotten completion, MCP schema, export, or integration test."
